OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain
OL,6,Fextending east to all areas this
OL,7,Fevening, initially light but some
OL,8,Fheavier outbreaks developing later
OL,9,Fthis evening and overnight. The rain
OL,10,Feasing towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,13,Fa few showers, these showers more
OL,14,Ffrequent over western Perthshire and
OL,15,Fthe Trossachs, with the best of the
OL,16,Fsunshine towards Angus.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
